---
const bars = [64, 82, 47, 91];
const heatmap = [0.15, 0.35, 0.55, 0.8, 0.95, 0.6, 0.25, 0.45, 0.7, 0.9, 0.5, 0.3, 0.1, 0.3, 0.5, 0.65];
---

<section class="site-section site-section--alt" aria-labelledby="value-title">
  <div class="site-container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-head__kicker">EXCEL'İN GÖRSEL GÜCÜ</span>
      <h2 id="value-title" class="section-head__title">Şablonların içinde neler var?</h2>
      <p class="section-head__lead">
        Her dosya, koşullu biçimlendirmenin güçlü araçlarıyla kurulur — rakamlar yorum gerektirmeden konuşur.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ul class="value-grid">
      <li class="value-card">
        <span class="value-card__code">CF-01 · VERİ ÇUBUKLARI</span>
        <h3 class="value-card__title">Veri Çubukları</h3>
        <div class="value-card__viz value-card__viz--bars" aria-hidden="true">
          {['OCA', 'ŞUB', 'MAR', 'NİS'].map((month, index) => (
            <span class="value-card__bar-row">
              <span class="value-card__bar-label">{month}</span>
              <span class="value-card__bar-track">
                <span class="value-card__bar-fill" style={`--w:${bars[index]}%`}></span>
              </span>
              <span class="value-card__bar-val">{bars[index]}</span>
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="value-card__text">Değerler hücre içinde görünür bar olarak karşılaştırılır.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="value-card">
        <span class="value-card__code">CF-02 · SPARKLINE</span>
        <h3 class="value-card__title">Eğilim Çizgileri</h3>
        <div class="value-card__viz" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 200 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="value-card__spark">
            <polyline
              points="0,50 28,44 56,47 84,36 112,40 140,26 168,30 200,16"
              fill="none"
              stroke="var(--xl-green)"
              stroke-width="2.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            />
            <circle cx="200" cy="16" r="4" fill="var(--xl-green)" />
          </svg>
          <span class="value-card__spark-meta"><span class="value-card__up">▲ %18</span> NET · 7 AY</span>
        </div>
        <p class="value-card__text">Trend satır içi grafikle; ayrı grafik sayfası gerekmez.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="value-card">
        <span class="value-card__code">CF-03 · İKON SETLERİ</span>
        <h3 class="value-card__title">Yön Göstergeleri</h3>
        <div class="value-card__viz value-card__viz--icons" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="value-card__icon-row"><span>Brüt Kâr</span><b class="value-card__up">▲ %24</b></span>
          <span class="value-card__icon-row"><span>Stok Devri</span><b class="value-card__flat">→ 4,2</b></span>
          <span class="value-card__icon-row"><span>Fire</span><b class="value-card__down">▼ %1,8</b></span>
          <span class="value-card__icon-row"><span>Tahsilat</span><b class="value-card__up">▲ %96</b></span>
        </div>
        <p class="value-card__text">Artış, düşüş ve sabit durum ikonlarla ayrışır.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="value-card">
        <span class="value-card__code">CF-04 · RENK ÖLÇEĞİ</span>
        <h3 class="value-card__title">Isı Haritası</h3>
        <div class="value-card__viz value-card__viz--heat" aria-hidden="true">
          {
            heatmap.map((alpha, index) => (
              <span
                class="value-card__heat-cell"
                style={`--a:${alpha};--d:${0.3 + index * 0.05}s`}
              ></span>
            ))
          }
        </div>
        <p class="value-card__text">Renk yoğunluğu ile riskli alanlar öne çıkar.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .value-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .value-grid > * {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .value-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--xl-border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .value-card__code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--xl-green);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .value-card__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--xl-ink-900);
  }
  .value-card__text {
    margin: auto 0 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--xl-ink-3);
  }
  .value-card__viz {
    margin: 4px 0 8px;
  }
  .value-card__viz--bars {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .value-card__bar-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--xl-ink-3);
  }
  .value-card__bar-label {
    width: 26px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .value-card__bar-track {
    flex: 1;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: var(--xl-paper);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .value-card__bar-fill {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    width: var(--w);
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: var(--xl-green);
    animation: bar-grow 0.8s var(--ease-out) both;
  }
  .value-card__bar-val {
    width: 22px;
    text-align: right;
  }
  @keyframes bar-grow {
    from {
      width: 0;
    }
  }
  .value-card__spark {
    width: 100%;
    height: 48px;
  }
  .value-card__spark-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--xl-ink-3);
  }
  .value-card__viz--icons {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .value-card__icon-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 5px 9px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: var(--xl-paper);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--xl-ink-3);
  }
  .value-card__up {
    color: var(--xl-green-dark);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .value-card__flat {
    color: var(--xl-ink-3);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .value-card__down {
    color: var(--xl-cf-red-ink, #9c0006);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .value-card__viz--heat {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 5px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .value-card__heat-cell {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--xl-green) calc(var(--a) * 100%), var(--xl-paper));
    animation: heat-fade 0.6s ease-out both;
    animation-delay: var(--d);
  }
  @keyframes heat-fade {
    from {
      opacity: 0.2;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .value-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .value-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
